 <j>  <Down>                  Select the next property
 <Ctrl-u>                     Move properties up one page
 <Ctrl-d>                     Move properties down one page
 <g>                          Select the first property
 <G>                          Select the last property
 <y>                          Copy the selected property value
 </>                          Open search
